    "title": "OHSAA District Wrestling: Avon, Avon Lake Stars Head to State Tournament! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n18 hours ago Four local wrestlers are set to compete in the OHSAA state tournament at Columbus' Jerome Schottenstein Center this weekend. Avon’s Eian Englehart and Avon Lake’s Ambrose Ieropoli, Brayden Patterson, and Destiny Cabot will represent their schools. Englehart boasts an impressive record of 43-1, while Cabot has a record of 34-7 in the Girls Division. All four wrestlers have advanced after solid performances in their respective district meets. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
